# DESK35, the ticket's own application: QED.
#
# Same gesture as d35.actions, but the program double-clicked is QED.NAP (the
# ported GEM editor, 501592 bytes, seeded into the root by method/seed.sh -- see
# that file for why it is not opened where make-sd-image.sh installs it).
#
#   C_TWO_WINDOWS  two windows on C:\, window 2 on top
#   D_QED          QED after it has drawn its menu bar and its first window
#   E_QED          the same screen 15 s later -- QED is interactive and does not
#                  terminate by itself, so there is no "desktop back" picture in
#                  this run; that one is d35-*-E-back.png (GEMWIN.NAP).
#
# Coordinate from the d-probe2 dump: 'QED.NAP' in window 2 box (165,279) 76x40
# -> click (203,295).
